 "traps": [
  "requirements.txt is exported by uv from pyproject.toml and lists transitive packages: Flask-SQLAlchemy, marshmallow-sqlalchemy and alembic are there next to the direct dependencies",
  "the themes are two npm packages, admin and core-beta (folder CTFd/themes/core); CTFd/themes/core-deprecated holds only built assets and no package.json",
  "both themes build with Vite and Vue but also ship Alpine.js and Bootstrap, at different major versions (4.3 and 5.3)",
  "the compose file uses MariaDB and Redis; MySQL and PostgreSQL appear only as CI service containers, and SQLite is the default when DATABASE_URL is empty",
  "mail goes either to SMTP (MAIL_SERVER) or to Mailgun (MAILGUN_API_KEY), uploads either to the filesystem or to S3 (UPLOAD_PROVIDER), all keys of CTFd/config.ini",
  "the only OAuth login is MajorLeagueCyber, whose URLs are defaults in CTFd/auth.py",
  "pytest is in the dev group; the GeoIP lookup reads a bundled MaxMind database, not a service",
  "only frameworks and services are measured; the other facets are in unknown"
 ],
